scenarios.prompt:
I'm building a roster page for our community garden. Can you check my animations and tell me what to change? Here is the CSS:

.card { transition: all 0.9s; }
.card:hover { transform: scale(1.1) rotate(2deg); }
.claim-btn { animation: pulse 1s infinite; }
@keyframes pulse { 0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 gold; } 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 20px transparent; } }
.panel { transition: height 0.6s; }
.hero-slides { animation: slide 4s linear infinite; }

The hero slides move on their own and I have no pause button. I haven't added any reduced-motion rules. A little confetti pops when someone claims a shift, for fun.
